  "question": {
    "text": "<p>In the following circuit the switch <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi></math>is closed at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>. The charge on the capacitor <math><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> as a function of time will be given by <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/cf3e8d94-bdb8-405b-897a-acb0ebdf3d17-image.png\" style=\"width: 240px; height: 141px;\" /></p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "kLD7F",
      "text": "<math><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mi>E</mi><mi> </mi><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">exp</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfenced></math>",
